      "statement": "`flux-local.yaml` runs on pull_request to `main` with per-PR concurrency (cancel-in-progress): a pre-job gates on `tj-actions/changed-files` over `kubernetes/**`; a test job runs `flux-local test --enable-helm --all-namespaces --sources flux-system` in the flux-local v8.4.0 container; a helmrelease/kustomization matrix job runs `flux-local diff` against the default branch (strip-attrs, 10000-byte limit, `--unified 6`) writing `diff.patch`, posts non-empty diffs as keyed PR comments via mshick/add-pr-comment (continue-on-error) and job summaries; and a `flux-local-status` aggregator with `if: always()` fails if test or diff failed, so branch protection can require just that check.",
